/Users/lchingen/tn-hivemind/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md:9058:**M5:** implemented durable event/cursor persistence, targeted leases, frozen inference checkpoints, explicit review, crash recovery and idempotent admission/ACK. A real Microsoft evidence replay attached five assessments and one change to existing research. Replaying its model result, admission and event produced no new provider calls or research records. Jev authentication, typed labels and scoring now work. On 20 matched agent-authored evidence cases, Jev agreed with 19 labels and DeepSeek with 17; on 12 event cases, DeepSeek matched all categorical labels while Jev missed some relevance, novelty, modality and relation labels. These small synthetic comparisons are mixed evidence, not independent accuracy claims. Jev stays in shadow mode. The full current audit agreed on 62/64 assessments; both disagreements were reviewed against the originals and did not justify support.
/Users/lchingen/tn-hivemind/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md:9064:**Measured cost:** this continuation made **140 provider calls**, estimated **$0.247309506 off-peak / $0.491183118 peak**. Including earlier M3/M4, **180 calls total $0.326093514 / $0.648751134**. All completed calls occurred outside weekday peak windows, so the lower estimate applies to the observed schedule; neither value is a reconciled invoice. Failed, truncated, rejected and development calls are included. Independent Decimal arithmetic reconciled each archived response with the usage ledger; unresolved reservations are $0 and the unchanged continuation allocation is $8. Jev accounts for 30 calls / $0.003435894. TN/search data, coding-agent and review labor, storage/network and tax remain unmetered. [Raw-usage audit](../evals/history/usage-audits-2026-09-22-23/continued-2026-09-23-usage-audit.json), [final query chain costs](../evals/narrative-query-chain-cost-2026-09-23.json).
/Users/lchingen/tn-hivemind/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md:9066:**Milestone self-review and fixes:** exact-passage deduplication, auditing later evidence attachments, directed review jobs, timezone ordering, pending-poll state preservation, committed-intent checks before acknowledgement, bounded Jev rounding tolerance, question-constraint validation, cache invalidation, safe HTTP write modes and current CLI defaults were checked and corrected. Detailed findings and unresolved limits are in [CODE_REVIEW](history/CODE_REVIEW.md). Final verification: **237 tests**, both documented demos, 309 immutable context files, structural/provenance audit of all real research, and browser interaction checks passed. Final handoff checks are recorded in [VALIDATION](history/VALIDATION.md).
