/Users/lchingen/tn-hivemind/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md:9078:Cost conclusion: API spend is small in this slice, but **22 calls for two reviewed hypotheses is not a production unit-cost estimate**. Twelve calls were rubric experiments; repeated truncation and semantic amendments are observable overhead. About 69% of output usage was reasoning. Tightening visible-answer prose did not reliably prevent truncation. Next work must measure recovery rate, untouched acceptance rate and review effort before extrapolating to a full universe or enabling Jev.
