    53	    handover's candidates; new_views: candidate id -> view id for the theses this write creates. Returns
    54	    (creations, memberships, notes): creations = [{local_id, name, scope, aliases}] in declaration order;
    55	    memberships = [(view_id, group_key, basis)] where group_key is a stored group_id or a local id of a creation."""
