   133	| G.g1: infrastructure investment and Blackwell/Rubin rollout | v1, v4, v5, v12, v18, v19, v20, v39, v42 | F1 persists: one group combines an investment cycle and a product rollout. |
   134	| G.g2: H200 China authorisation | v9 | Single-member group; permitted by the contract. |
