   136	| G.g4: Taiwan AI-chip export ban consideration | v35 | Separate policy process. |
   137	| G.g5: Amazon–Globalstar acquisition | v45 | Separate transaction. |
   138	
   139	There are **32 ungrouped theses**. Ungrouped does not mean missing membership: company financial lines normally need no group.
   140	
