  2218	## D154 · 2026-10-25 · The keyed view contract as built and measured on the bootstrap documents (T1–T2d)
  2219	
  2220	- Under D153 (Alex: "T2可以按照你看完T1的结果自己思索之后开始动工…我要看的就是量化的结果收敛"), the contract of
  2221	  `docs/poc/keyed-views-plan.md` was built into the default pipeline behind prompt version v4 (`poc/config/poc-v15.json`):
  2222	  every candidate view carries `measure` (closed list), `scope`, `period_start/end`, `basis`, `unit`, `event_type`; every rung
  2223	  carries numeric `lo/hi`; the ledger stores them (`view_keys`, rung bounds); the service judges claims on the numbers.
  2224	- What the four small runs on the same twenty bootstrap documents taught, each turned into a code rule and a test
  2225	  (`docs/poc/pipeline-tuning-log.md` T1–T2d): the key is a necessary, not a sufficient, condition of identity (T1: exact
  2226	  keys over-merged a run-rate into revenue); the model must not spell the scope or convert the fiscal year (T2: four tax-rate
  2227	  views, a wrong Compute & Networking period); a watched scope is recognised by the list's aliases (T2b: hyperscaler capex and
  2228	  the H200 licence refused on spelling); the unit belongs to the key (a level and a growth rate collided); the model's answer
  2229	  to "same quantity?" on a same-key pair is not stable between samples (T2c), so where code owns the key (scope from the
  2230	  list or none) code decides identity, and a merge across periods or quantities is refused whatever the model says.
  2231	- Result on the twenty documents: 11 views, 0 duplicate keys, 0 product-trivia views, the H200 licence, the Rubin shipment,
  2232	  hyperscaler capex and the export rule all open (the sealed run opened 10 views with duplicates; poc-v14 opened 15 with four
  2233	  duplicates). The watch-list gate was not exercised by filings (review pool empty); the week run (T4) exercises it.
  2234	- Known limits recorded, not patched: a basis of n/a on an existing view accepts both GAAP and non-GAAP candidates (right for
  2235	  NVIDIA's joint guidance, to be re-read on a company with distinct guidance); a statement about another year can still be
  2236	  linked as evidence to this year's view by the extraction when no view of that year exists (an evidence-link class, not a
  2237	  candidate class); grouping (research subjects as universe objects, 2.3) is not yet in the default pipeline.
