    46	
    47	| Option | Facts | Fit |
    48	|---|---|---|
    49	| `BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3` | 0.6B parameters on the bge-m3 base, multilingual, query–passage pairs → relevance score (sigmoid to [0,1]), 512-token input, Apache-2.0, meant to rerank the top 100 of a retriever ([model card](https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3)) | the default local cross-encoder: free to run, both languages, fits a thesis card (≈150 tokens) and a group card (≈300 tokens) within 512 |
